15 PFTs
5  GDD PFTs
5  Live Pools
*******************************************************************************************************
                      GDD-Based Phenology Parameter Definitions and Units:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LP=Leaf Pool
FR=Fine Root Pool
CR=Coarse Root Pool
WP=Stem/Wood Pool
PP=Product Pool

-----Growing Season Start Parameters (FlagG)-----
DayMinI = Minimum light to start growing season for increasing day lengths (hr)
DayOffD = Parameter to start growing season for decreasing day lengths (hr)
          > 0: Offset from maximum day length
	  < 0: Daylength threshold to restrict day lengths (winter wheat)
PrLen = Length of time to average precipitation (days)
PrBef = Number of days before precip max to allow planting (days)
PrAft = Number of days after precip max to allow planting (days)

TAWMin  = Minimum fraction of total available water (TAW) in
            top three layers to start growing season (-)
TAWLen  = Number of sequential days TAW_FTop > FlagG_WMin (days)
TempMin = Minimum temperature to start growing season (K)
TempMax = Maximum tempeature to start growing season (K)
TempLen = Number of sequential days temperature > FlagG_Tmin (days)

-----Growing Season Reset Parameters (FlagA)-----
ALen   = Running-mean length for Assim_Mean
AReset = Threshold value for FAssim to set FlagA

-----Growing Season Parameters-----
GDD_PD = Stages determined using:
          1=GDD; 2=DAPD (days after planting); 3=DAPDNF (above freezing)
GDD_TBASE = Temperature base for GDD calculation (F)
GDD_TMax  = Temperature maximum for GDD calculation (F)

NStg = Number of phenological stages
Seed_C = Carbon contained in seed (g C)
Seed_Release = Carbon released daily from seed (g C)
GSL_Max = Maximum number of days of growing season prior to harvest (days)

------Phenology Stage Parameters-----
ThrP = Thresholds between stages (-)
LP_Alloc=Leaf pool allocation fractions per stages (-)
FR_Alloc=Fine root allocation fractions per stages (-)
WP_Alloc=Stem allocation fractions per stages (-)
PP_Alloc=Product allocation fractions per stages (-)
M_Adj=Adjust allocation fractions from moisture rules?
T_Adj=Adjust allocation fractions from temperature rules?
LPT=Leaf pool transfer per phenology stage (daily fraction)
VMAX=Rubisco velocity of sun leaf per phenology stage (mol/m2/s)

*********************************************************************************************************

